OL,3,GNEWSAA14 shut in both directions after
OL,4,Avehicle overturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists faced delays after a crash
OL,7,Finvolving an overturned vehicle closed
OL,8,Fthe A14 in both directions.
OL,10,FThe eastbound and westbound
OL,11,Fcarriageways on the outskirts of
OL,12,FIpswich were shut after an accident
OL,13,Fbetween Seven Hills and the Nacton
OL,14,FInterchange.
OL,16,FAccording to National Highways East
OL,17,F"all emergency services" were on the
OL,18,Fscene and there were two-mile queues of
OL,19,Ftraffic, causing delays of 30 minutes.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
